  "changed_factors": [
    "Extend Track 1B Deconflicted Piecewise Coupling from t1-coupling-v3 to t1-coupling-v4 under one global clock-free recipe: (1) bypass unconditional cross-chart Laguerre slot reassignment whenever Recipe.encoder_mode != 'none' so encoder-coupled models (AE-GAN, VAE-GAN) preserve learned encoder-to-prior slot correspondence across all mode counts; (2) tighten streaming sub-chart novelty insertion from 2.2 to 3.2 r_near (capped by 0.035 d_max) to prevent >2.2 sigma Gaussian tail draws from splitting unimodal clusters; and (3) set optimizer_svd_backend='native' alongside polar_cpu_v1 and quintic per_offset convolutions."
